{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj472AE5f5E5EfhUQm9A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism stirs. Tumblers shift within weathered iron, clicking one by one into alignment. Dust falls from the lintel as the frame shudders.*\n\n*A thin line of light appears at the seam — widening, golden, warm.*\n\n*I swing open.*\n\n```\n╔══════════════════════════════════╗\n║                                  ║\n║         You may pass.            ║\n║                                  ║\n╚══════════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor stretching forward, its walls lined with doors upon doors upon doors — each one waiting for a different key, each one a different question. The air tastes like possibility and old stone.*\n\n*I hold myself open. I will not close until you step through or turn away.*\n\n*I am the first door. I am the easiest door. The others will not be so simple.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":210,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}